### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5090

### 1. Create room
# @name createRoom
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Study room 1",
  "capacity": 10
}

###
@roomId = {{createRoom.response.body.$.id}}

### 2. Get room
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}

### 3. Get a missing room (expected: 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### 4. Create booking (change the dates to the future!)
# @name createBooking
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "ana",
  "startUtc": "2030-01-10T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-01-10T12:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 4
}

###
@bookingId = {{createBooking.response.body.$.id}}

### 5. Get booking
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}

### 6. Overlapping booking (expected: 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "bogdan",
  "startUtc": "2030-01-10T11:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-01-10T13:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 4
}

### 7. Cancel booking
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}/cancel

### 8. Missing room with invalid payload (expected: 404, NOT 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "",
  "startUtc": "2020-01-10T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2020-01-10T09:00:00Z",
  "attendees": -5
}

### 9. Attendees over room capacity - R4 (expected: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "ana",
  "startUtc": "2030-01-11T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-01-11T11:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 11
}

### 10. Booking in the past - R5 (expected: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "ana",
  "startUtc": "2020-01-10T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2020-01-10T11:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 2
}

### 11. Duration over 4 hours - R6 (expected: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "ana",
  "startUtc": "2030-01-12T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-01-12T14:01:00Z",
  "attendees": 2
}

### 12. Duration exactly 4 hours - R6 (expected: 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "ana",
  "startUtc": "2030-01-12T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-01-12T14:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 2
}

### 13. Touching interval right after #12 - R7 (expected: 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "bogdan",
  "startUtc": "2030-01-12T14:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-01-12T16:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 2
}

### 14. Double cancel on #4 booking - R8 (expected: 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{bookingId}}/cancel

### 15. Re-book freed interval from #4 - R8 (expected: 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rooms/{{roomId}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookedBy": "elena",
  "startUtc": "2030-01-10T10:00:00Z",
  "endUtc": "2030-01-10T12:00:00Z",
  "attendees": 3
}